WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.690
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:35.960 --> 01:40.110
[River of No Return]

3
01:40.130 --> 01:42.970
[Episode 3: Iron Alliance]

4
01:45.420 --> 01:46.229
Will you talk?

5
01:47.729 --> 01:48.930
I'll talk. I'll talk.

6
01:49.039 --> 01:49.900
I'm from the Iron Alliance.

7
01:49.900 --> 01:50.460
What?

8
01:50.680 --> 01:51.740
The Iron Alliance?

9
01:52.020 --> 01:53.740
You're from the Iron Alliance?

10
01:53.740 --> 01:55.890
Why were you outside Lord Guo's house?

11
01:56.759 --> 01:57.870
Do you know

12
01:58.340 --> 01:59.340
how Lord Guo died?

13
02:00.730 --> 02:02.820
The envoy only told me

14
02:02.930 --> 02:04.990
to watch the body being carried away.

15
02:05.200 --> 02:06.090
So,

16
02:06.940 --> 02:09.539
your Iron Alliance had Lord Guo killed, right?

17
02:10.070 --> 02:11.800
I really don't know about that.

18
02:11.820 --> 02:12.650
You don't know this,

19
02:12.650 --> 02:13.980
and you don't know that.

20
02:14.380 --> 02:15.470
Do you know anything at all?

21
02:15.470 --> 02:16.750
The Iron Alliance will gather

22
02:16.750 --> 02:18.160
at Xinghua Restaurant today at the You hour.

23
02:18.160 --> 02:19.700
I've told you everything I know.

24
02:19.700 --> 02:21.320
My lord, please be merciful.

25
02:21.340 --> 02:22.520
Spare me, my lord.

26
02:22.829 --> 02:25.490
♪ I brave the wind, I hit the ground ♪

27
02:25.520 --> 02:25.829
♪ I take the blows head-on, never crying out in pain ♪

28
02:25.829 --> 02:27.350
[Yingtian Prefecture]

29
02:28.290 --> 02:31.070
♪ My life hangs by a thread, my worries buried in my bones ♪

30
02:31.290 --> 02:33.180
♪ Whatever I owe, I'll repay in time ♪

31
02:34.690 --> 02:35.490
Uncle Laoliu.

32
02:35.630 --> 02:36.810
Have you seen my father?

33
02:36.810 --> 02:37.310
No.

34
02:37.860 --> 02:39.160
I haven't seen him all day.

35
02:39.160 --> 02:40.020
He didn't come?

36
02:40.540 --> 02:42.820
I just sent him to the main hall.

37
02:43.970 --> 02:45.829
It's best if he doesn't come back.

38
02:46.950 --> 02:47.950
If you see him,

39
02:48.760 --> 02:49.960
don't bring him here.

40
02:50.570 --> 02:51.790
Hey, Uncle Laoliu,

41
02:52.190 --> 02:54.260
don't beat around the bush. Just say it.

42
02:54.260 --> 02:55.720
Didn't you see it that day?

43
02:57.310 --> 02:58.380
The Censor Guo Zhimin

44
02:58.380 --> 03:00.510
didn't die from the earthquake at all.

45
03:00.640 --> 03:04.300
Didn't you think about why your father closed the case so hastily?

46
03:05.540 --> 03:06.810
After the Crown Prince's treasure ship blew up,

47
03:06.810 --> 03:08.250
the earlier Huliu explosive case

48
03:08.250 --> 03:10.250
is not as simple as it seemed, right?

49
03:11.300 --> 03:12.360
They are all saying

50
03:12.510 --> 03:15.110
that your father has ties to the Iron Alliance.

51
03:16.700 --> 03:17.540
Who spread it?

52
03:17.990 --> 03:18.500
Who is it?

53
03:18.500 --> 03:19.140
-Who? -Stop shouting.

54
03:19.140 --> 03:20.260
-Did you spread it? -Stop shouting.

55
03:20.260 --> 03:20.950
Go, go, go.

56
03:21.020 --> 03:22.470
-No. Go, go, go. -Did you two spread it?

57
03:22.470 --> 03:22.790
Go.

58
03:22.790 --> 03:24.280
-Hurry. -Let me see who's running their mouth!

59
03:24.280 --> 03:24.790
Who?

60
03:25.750 --> 03:26.350
Go, go, go.

61
03:26.630 --> 03:27.829
I never saw you today.

62
03:27.980 --> 03:28.770
Stop. Enough.

63
03:28.770 --> 03:30.190
If you spread rumors again,

64
03:30.190 --> 03:31.150
I'll kill you!

65
03:32.350 --> 03:33.190
Seriously.

66
03:42.079 --> 03:43.820
You know you saved the Crown Prince, right?

67
03:43.820 --> 03:45.310
What are you talking about out of nowhere?

68
03:45.310 --> 03:46.510
You definitely know.

69
03:47.700 --> 03:49.230
I'm just a lowly constable.

70
03:49.640 --> 03:51.700
How could I run into the Crown Prince?

71
03:52.579 --> 03:53.820
Why brings you here?

72
03:54.540 --> 03:55.400
I asked around.

73
03:57.310 --> 03:58.980
Before the treasure ship exploded and sank,

74
03:58.980 --> 04:00.290
you and your father were already investigating

75
04:00.290 --> 04:01.210
the Huliu explosive case,

76
04:01.210 --> 04:01.810
right?

77
04:06.130 --> 04:07.170
What else did you find out?

78
04:07.170 --> 04:08.710
You have an unmarried younger sister.

79
04:08.710 --> 04:09.690
Little Xingren.

80
04:10.280 --> 04:11.750
You can ask around.

81
04:12.080 --> 04:13.300
But I'm warning you.

82
04:13.580 --> 04:15.580
Don't get any ideas about my family.

83
04:18.140 --> 04:19.370
Your father has a lover

84
04:19.370 --> 04:20.490
in the Fule Brothel.

85
04:20.490 --> 04:21.820
So what?

86
04:22.900 --> 04:23.750
Besides,

87
04:23.840 --> 04:24.900
is the Fule Brothel

88
04:24.960 --> 04:26.610
a place for an official like you

89
04:26.610 --> 04:27.550
to go?

90
04:27.580 --> 04:28.950
Can you afford it?

91
04:29.310 --> 04:30.840
What are you talking about?

92
04:30.850 --> 04:31.940
Let me remind you.

93
04:33.320 --> 04:34.800
Given how you've treated the Crown Prince,

94
04:34.800 --> 04:37.550
you could already be charged with Great Disrespect.

95
04:37.550 --> 04:38.810
According to the laws of Ming,

96
04:38.810 --> 04:39.820
anyone who commits Great Disrespect

97
04:39.820 --> 04:40.960
is treated as treason.

98
04:40.960 --> 04:43.020
All men in the family, regardless of severe illness or disability,

99
04:43.020 --> 04:43.970
will be beheaded.

100
04:43.970 --> 04:45.040
Their mothers, daughters, wives, concubines, and sisters

101
04:45.040 --> 04:46.810
will be given to the families of meritorious officials as slaves.

102
04:46.810 --> 04:47.580
Got it?

103
04:49.280 --> 04:50.100
I see.

104
04:50.690 --> 04:51.630
You need my help.

105
04:55.320 --> 04:57.890
If you need help, just say so.

106
04:58.280 --> 05:01.140
What's the point of beating around the bush so much?

107
05:01.580 --> 05:02.140
Speak.

108
05:02.720 --> 05:03.820
What does His Highness the Crown Prince

109
05:03.820 --> 05:04.820
want me to do?

110
05:06.160 --> 05:08.090
How much are you planning to pay me?

111
05:08.310 --> 05:10.640
That Good-for-Nothing just loves money.

112
05:10.820 --> 05:12.700
Just give him whatever he wants.

113
05:18.320 --> 05:19.460
His Highness was right.

114
05:19.460 --> 05:20.690
You only have eyes for money.

115
05:20.690 --> 05:21.240
Yes.

116
05:22.270 --> 05:23.600
I only care about money.

117
05:29.020 --> 05:30.150
Good-for-Nothing.

118
05:34.630 --> 05:35.950
Steamed buns!

119
05:36.000 --> 05:36.120
[Xinghua Restaurant]

120
05:36.120 --> 05:38.020
Freshly steamed buns!

121
05:43.010 --> 05:44.270
I'm sorry, sir.

122
05:47.400 --> 05:48.530
Please bear with us.

123
05:50.840 --> 05:51.840
How can you be sure

124
05:51.870 --> 05:53.930
this is the Iron Alliance's hideout?

125
05:59.110 --> 06:01.310
Three hundred taels of 80% pure silver,

126
06:01.580 --> 06:02.780
paid in full upfront.

127
06:05.930 --> 06:06.570
Can I...

128
06:06.590 --> 06:08.380
You work for the Crown Prince,

129
06:08.900 --> 06:10.630
and you can't afford 300 taels?

130
06:11.260 --> 06:12.310
Not a penny less.

131
06:13.200 --> 06:15.460
I mean, can I pay you after the job's done?

132
06:16.110 --> 06:17.570
Do you even know the rules?

133
06:17.780 --> 06:18.550
No.

134
06:19.020 --> 06:19.840
At a time like this,

135
06:19.840 --> 06:21.720
where am I supposed to get that much silver for you?

136
06:21.720 --> 06:22.600
That's your problem.

137
06:22.600 --> 06:23.610
What does it have to do with me?

138
06:23.610 --> 06:24.940
Figure it out yourself.

139
06:26.790 --> 06:29.190
You're taking advantage of the situation.

140
06:29.640 --> 06:30.550
Listen.

141
06:30.940 --> 06:32.800
Divide the silver into two parts.

142
06:33.050 --> 06:34.380
Send one part to

143
06:34.820 --> 06:35.950
the fifth house on Zhongxiang Lane

144
06:35.950 --> 06:37.930
in Tangfanglang, northwest of Zhenhuai Bridge.

145
06:37.930 --> 06:39.930
Give it to my little sister, Wu Yulu.

146
06:39.930 --> 06:40.990
Send the other part

147
06:40.990 --> 06:43.010
to the third lane, eighth courtyard, Fule Brothel, Wuning Bridge.

148
06:43.010 --> 06:43.970
Give it to Granny Tong.

149
06:43.970 --> 06:44.570
Got it?

150
06:44.570 --> 06:45.370
Fule Brothel?

151
06:47.220 --> 06:48.820
You want me to send the silver

152
06:49.340 --> 06:50.380
to a brothel?

153
06:51.190 --> 06:53.120
What's it to you what place this is?

154
06:53.540 --> 06:54.930
It's my silver.

155
06:55.200 --> 06:57.180
I can send it wherever I want.

156
06:58.130 --> 06:59.590
Is it any of your business?

157
07:04.750 --> 07:05.580
Fine.

158
07:08.870 --> 07:10.270
With 300 taels of silver,

159
07:10.700 --> 07:11.630
what can I get?

160
07:13.630 --> 07:14.140
Here.

161
07:16.310 --> 07:17.140
Look.

162
07:18.190 --> 07:19.190
These people

163
07:19.930 --> 07:21.330
are clearing the streets

164
07:21.630 --> 07:24.430
and frequently going in and out of the restaurant.

165
07:25.170 --> 07:28.080
They're either gathering people or up to something.

166
07:28.080 --> 07:29.630
Sir, I'm really sorry.

167
07:29.650 --> 07:30.910
How about you close up early today?

168
07:30.910 --> 07:32.170
Here, take the silver.

169
07:32.880 --> 07:33.990
I'm really sorry.

170
07:37.390 --> 07:39.190
Why are you still standing here?

171
07:39.320 --> 07:40.320
Hurry back to the palace,

172
07:40.320 --> 07:41.570
report to the Crown Prince,

173
07:41.570 --> 07:42.970
and ask him for the money.

174
07:43.140 --> 07:44.200
After this is done,

175
07:44.510 --> 07:47.570
you and your father will have rendered a great service.

176
07:49.220 --> 07:49.950
Stay here.

177
07:50.280 --> 07:51.460
Don't leave even for a step.

178
07:51.460 --> 07:52.520
Do you understand?

179
07:52.780 --> 07:54.020
Don't worry. Go.

180
07:54.100 --> 07:55.020
When I do things,

181
07:55.020 --> 07:56.220
you can rest assured.

182
08:21.550 --> 08:22.610
Greetings, Envoy.

183
09:01.270 --> 09:03.460
Waiter, two more jars of good wine!

184
09:03.790 --> 09:05.790
Okay, okay, okay. Wait, wait, wait.

185
09:06.550 --> 09:09.280
Food for Chunxiang Pavilion on the second floor!

186
09:17.830 --> 09:19.260
If we are on the same side,

187
09:20.670 --> 09:22.080
Yulu is my sister.

188
09:22.980 --> 09:25.910
I was never part of your Iron Alliance.

189
09:26.080 --> 09:29.080
And I definitely don't want to be involved with you now.

190
09:29.080 --> 09:29.620
Do it.

191
10:00.070 --> 10:02.100
Is the son you brought to Jinling

192
10:03.450 --> 10:05.110
the person we are looking for?

193
10:07.500 --> 10:09.190
Please.

194
10:09.790 --> 10:11.550
I really don't want to get involved

195
10:11.550 --> 10:13.610
in the Iron Alliance's mess anymore.

196
10:14.070 --> 10:15.930
Please let my son and daughter go.

197
10:16.390 --> 10:17.620
I just want them

198
10:18.000 --> 10:19.670
to live a normal life.

199
10:22.310 --> 10:23.460
A normal life?

200
10:25.120 --> 10:26.030
Do you know how the others

201
10:26.030 --> 10:27.490
have lived all these years?

202
10:27.490 --> 10:28.750
The court has been hunting us down.

203
10:28.750 --> 10:30.230
Some of our people have grown old; others are dead.

204
10:30.230 --> 10:31.700
You think you can just say, "I was never one of you, and I want nothing to do with you,"

205
10:31.700 --> 10:33.100
and wash your hands of it?

206
10:34.840 --> 10:36.050
Looks like I'll have to use a little force

207
10:36.050 --> 10:37.960
to get you, Iron Lion, to talk.

208
10:40.690 --> 10:42.020
What are you going to do?

209
10:42.430 --> 10:44.560
The person you are looking for is dead!

210
10:45.460 --> 10:47.100
Do you think you can fool me by saying he's dead?

211
10:47.100 --> 10:47.630
Beat him!

212
10:48.430 --> 10:49.490
He died of illness!

213
10:50.340 --> 10:51.220
Get down!

214
10:55.190 --> 10:57.270
If you want to live, get out of here!

215
11:22.120 --> 11:23.450
Did you see Wu Dingyuan?

216
11:23.500 --> 11:24.230
Wu Dingyuan?

217
11:24.960 --> 11:26.020
Who is Wu Dingyuan?

218
11:26.070 --> 11:27.000
I don't know him.

219
11:29.910 --> 11:31.240
This Good-for-Nothing

220
11:31.620 --> 11:32.880
doesn't keep his word.

221
11:45.660 --> 11:46.870
Seize them all!

222
11:49.340 --> 11:51.100
Don't let any of them escape!

223
11:51.290 --> 11:51.950
Don't move!

224
11:52.220 --> 11:52.790
Stop!

225
11:53.390 --> 11:53.990
Don't run!

226
12:41.150 --> 12:42.500
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

227
12:42.540 --> 12:44.040
♪ I patrol the streets, swaying along day after day ♪

228
12:44.100 --> 12:45.970
♪ A jug of wine in hand, a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

229
12:46.000 --> 12:47.370
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run when they see me ♪

230
12:47.400 --> 12:48.900
♪ Through storms and flames, I press on ♪

231
12:48.930 --> 12:50.660
♪ I drag my life along like a rope ♪

232
12:50.680 --> 12:52.240
♪ They call me a young constable ♪

233
12:52.260 --> 12:54.000
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

234
12:54.020 --> 12:55.550
♪ Isn't mine to rule ♪

235
13:13.860 --> 13:15.100
Quick, after them!

236
13:15.550 --> 13:17.950
Round up every last one of those fugitives!

237
14:11.220 --> 14:12.070
Still eating?

238
14:14.550 --> 14:15.620
Put the bowl down.

239
14:22.250 --> 14:23.040
You...

240
14:23.670 --> 14:24.670
You little brat.

241
14:24.960 --> 14:25.690
Take it away.

242
14:26.200 --> 14:27.030
Why should I?

243
14:27.410 --> 14:28.340
You are my son.

244
14:28.480 --> 14:29.480
Are you my father?

245
14:29.480 --> 14:30.190
Whether I'm your father or not,

246
14:30.190 --> 14:31.450
you can't point this thing at me.

247
14:31.450 --> 14:31.870
Take it away.

248
14:31.870 --> 14:33.000
Whether I'm your son or not,

249
14:33.000 --> 14:34.330
you shouldn't lie to me!

250
14:34.740 --> 14:36.360
Shouldn't you be at the prefectural office?

251
14:36.360 --> 14:38.030
What were you doing at Xinghua Restaurant?

252
14:38.030 --> 14:38.550
Talk!

253
14:38.830 --> 14:41.120
I don't have time to talk nonsense with you right now.

254
14:41.120 --> 14:43.050
Go as far away as possible right now.

255
14:43.050 --> 14:44.620
Wait for me at Zhengyang Gate tomorrow.

256
14:44.620 --> 14:45.700
Zhengyang Gate?

257
14:45.720 --> 14:47.310
Why would I go to Zhengyang Gate?

258
14:47.310 --> 14:49.240
-Stand still! -What are you doing?

259
14:49.330 --> 14:49.890
Talk!

260
14:54.530 --> 14:55.100
Father.

261
14:56.620 --> 14:58.150
You must tell me today.

262
14:58.590 --> 15:01.360
What is your relationship with the Iron Alliance?

263
15:01.360 --> 15:02.910
Why did you kneel to that little girl

264
15:02.910 --> 15:04.670
at Xinghua Restaurant?

265
15:04.700 --> 15:05.790
Why?

266
15:07.310 --> 15:08.570
Why did Lord Guo Zhimin

267
15:08.740 --> 15:09.580
die?

268
15:10.580 --> 15:12.000
The Sanshan Street explosion,

269
15:12.000 --> 15:13.080
the treasure ship bombing—

270
15:13.080 --> 15:14.140
you've played dumb

271
15:14.430 --> 15:16.160
about every one of these cases.

272
15:16.270 --> 15:16.860
Father.

273
15:17.270 --> 15:18.430
Tell me the truth.

274
15:18.670 --> 15:20.910
Are you in some kind of trouble?

275
15:21.480 --> 15:22.950
Listen to me.

276
15:23.200 --> 15:24.930
Stay as far away from those people at Xinghua Restaurant as possible.

277
15:24.930 --> 15:26.360
The rest has nothing to do with you.

278
15:26.360 --> 15:27.720
Then what does it have to do with me?

279
15:27.720 --> 15:28.780
Stand right there!

280
15:30.050 --> 15:32.150
I can't tell what's true and what's a lie

281
15:32.150 --> 15:33.480
when you speak anymore.

282
15:33.930 --> 15:36.130
You must explain it to me clearly today.

283
15:36.530 --> 15:37.990
Are you interrogating me?

284
15:38.320 --> 15:39.500
So what if I am?

285
15:39.960 --> 15:40.600
I am interrogating you.

286
15:40.600 --> 15:41.820
And you're poking me with that?

287
15:41.820 --> 15:42.500
I am.

288
15:42.740 --> 15:44.060
Come on, poke me through.

289
15:44.060 --> 15:44.680
Poke me through.

290
15:44.680 --> 15:46.230
Come on, stab me!

291
15:54.980 --> 15:55.530
Father.

292
15:56.980 --> 15:58.700
Can you just listen to me?

293
16:00.020 --> 16:01.620
The Crown Prince is not dead.

294
16:02.030 --> 16:03.390
I saved him.

295
16:04.980 --> 16:06.240
Wait, what did you say?

296
16:07.500 --> 16:09.560
Did you really save the Crown Prince?

297
16:09.650 --> 16:10.620
Yes.

298
16:11.860 --> 16:13.100
He owes me a favor.

299
16:13.390 --> 16:14.190
Well, Father.

300
16:14.270 --> 16:14.700
Hey.

301
16:15.390 --> 16:16.720
If you have any trouble,

302
16:16.770 --> 16:18.070
I'll have him take care of it for you.

303
16:18.070 --> 16:19.100
But you have

304
16:19.100 --> 16:20.430
to tell me.

305
16:26.620 --> 16:27.190
You...

306
16:28.580 --> 16:30.410
You can't be involved in this case anymore.

307
16:30.410 --> 16:31.940
The people involved in this

308
16:32.170 --> 16:32.890
are all people...

309
16:32.890 --> 16:35.090
are all people we can't afford to cross.

310
16:35.170 --> 16:36.050
L-Listen to me.

311
16:36.050 --> 16:37.460
Don't get involved in this anymore.

312
16:37.460 --> 16:38.190
-I… -Go away.

313
16:38.190 --> 16:39.580
Didn't I tell you—

314
16:39.820 --> 16:40.910
Don't follow me!

315
16:42.700 --> 16:43.550
Don't go home.

316
16:58.580 --> 16:59.790
Envoy. Envoy.

317
16:59.980 --> 17:01.040
It's his carriage.

318
17:38.230 --> 17:39.090
You go that way.

319
17:45.330 --> 17:46.130
Run.

320
17:47.040 --> 17:47.980
Keep running.

321
18:06.770 --> 18:08.570
You can't escape, Zhong Eryong.

322
19:51.890 --> 19:52.750
Your Highness.

323
19:53.520 --> 19:55.720
There is something I don't understand.

324
19:55.830 --> 19:58.200
Since the Huliu explosive

325
19:58.560 --> 19:59.990
was stolen from the palace,

326
19:59.990 --> 20:01.060
why not send Eunuch Zhu

327
20:01.060 --> 20:03.790
to conduct a strict investigation in the palace?

328
20:05.560 --> 20:07.020
In the secondary capital,

329
20:07.700 --> 20:08.900
no one can be trusted.

330
20:10.980 --> 20:12.130
If that's the case,

331
20:12.500 --> 20:13.740
why does Your Highness

332
20:13.740 --> 20:15.470
insist on entering the palace?

333
20:16.300 --> 20:17.850
You're isolated and without allies in the palace,

334
20:17.850 --> 20:19.650
leaving you in grave danger.

335
20:44.570 --> 20:45.790
Nothing ventured,

336
20:47.090 --> 20:48.690
nothing gained.

337
20:49.690 --> 20:50.550
Your Highness.

338
20:50.670 --> 20:51.760
Zhu Buhua is here.

339
21:59.670 --> 22:00.960
Your servant Zhu Buhua

340
22:01.190 --> 22:02.990
pays respects to Your Highness.

341
22:04.260 --> 22:06.590
As the eunuch commander of the Brave Warriors Camp,

342
22:06.590 --> 22:08.260
when Your Highness was in danger,

343
22:08.260 --> 22:10.590
I failed to fulfill my duty to protect you.

344
22:10.690 --> 22:12.170
That's in the past.

345
22:12.460 --> 22:14.260
Why do you keep talking about it?

346
22:14.890 --> 22:16.550
Rest assured, Your Highness.

347
22:16.800 --> 22:18.260
The danger you faced today

348
22:18.590 --> 22:19.850
will not happen again.

349
22:20.060 --> 22:21.500
I have ordered the Brave Warriors Camp

350
22:21.500 --> 22:22.630
to patrol strictly.

351
22:23.410 --> 22:25.170
We dare not slack off.

352
22:25.630 --> 22:28.090
You've only been in Jinling for a few months.

353
22:28.260 --> 22:29.980
You are unfamiliar with the people and the place,

354
22:29.980 --> 22:32.240
and you only have a few hundred soldiers.

355
22:33.080 --> 22:35.340
Just guarding the Imperial City alone

356
22:35.740 --> 22:37.800
is probably more than you can handle.

357
22:37.800 --> 22:38.560
Get up.

358
22:39.080 --> 22:40.080
I don't blame you.

359
22:45.770 --> 22:46.440
Come here.

360
23:01.470 --> 23:02.410
Let me ask you.

361
23:08.040 --> 23:11.500
The Huliu explosive that blew up the ship came from the palace.

362
23:13.540 --> 23:15.090
The ones who want me dead

363
23:16.090 --> 23:18.220
are not just the Iron Alliance, right?

364
23:19.590 --> 23:20.130
This...

365
23:22.370 --> 23:23.970
Who do you think in this world

366
23:25.190 --> 23:26.960
wants me dead

367
23:28.200 --> 23:29.280
the most?

368
23:32.220 --> 23:33.080
Your Highness,

369
23:33.430 --> 23:35.430
I really dare not make wild guesses.

370
23:35.520 --> 23:36.760
If Your Highness gives the order,

371
23:36.760 --> 23:38.630
I will definitely have

372
23:38.630 --> 23:40.910
all the living officials in Jinling arrested

373
23:40.910 --> 23:42.710
and interrogate them one by one.

374
23:46.170 --> 23:47.030
Your Highness.

375
23:47.370 --> 23:48.900
I have one more thing to say,

376
23:49.060 --> 23:50.470
but I'm not sure if I should.

377
23:50.470 --> 23:52.170
Aren't you already saying it?

378
23:53.960 --> 23:55.670
After I found out that the Huliu explosive

379
23:55.670 --> 23:56.870
was stolen from the palace,

380
23:56.870 --> 23:59.500
I immediately sent Wu Buping, the chief constable of Yingtian Prefecture,

381
23:59.500 --> 24:00.900
to investigate the case.

382
24:01.180 --> 24:04.630
But I don't know why Lord Zheng ordered me

383
24:04.850 --> 24:06.540
to move all the remaining Huliu explosives

384
24:06.540 --> 24:07.880
out of the palace.

385
24:10.330 --> 24:11.730
From what you're saying,

386
24:12.540 --> 24:14.470
do you think there's anything else

387
24:14.520 --> 24:16.250
suspicious about this matter?

388
24:19.430 --> 24:20.290
Your Highness.

389
24:20.450 --> 24:21.930
I'm not smart enough.

390
24:22.110 --> 24:24.510
T-There are some things I can't figure out.

391
24:25.430 --> 24:27.610
I'm just telling you exactly

392
24:28.130 --> 24:29.850
what I saw and heard,

393
24:29.980 --> 24:31.000
Your Highness.

394
24:40.160 --> 24:41.760
What's wrong with your face?

395
24:53.170 --> 24:54.030
Your Highness.

396
24:54.480 --> 24:55.200
I...

397
24:55.560 --> 24:57.620
I'm just not used to the climate here.

398
24:57.690 --> 24:58.930
I'm used to the north.

399
24:59.260 --> 25:01.280
Jinling is hot and humid.

400
25:01.760 --> 25:03.410
I can't eat or sleep well.

401
25:03.670 --> 25:05.200
It's really hard to endure.

402
25:10.700 --> 25:11.720
I see.

403
25:16.190 --> 25:18.650
A person's skin is like a paper lantern.

404
25:19.350 --> 25:20.880
Trouble comes from within.

405
25:21.590 --> 25:22.720
If it burns through,

406
25:23.680 --> 25:25.210
it will be hard to deal with.

407
25:29.460 --> 25:30.410
Zhu Buhua.

408
25:31.890 --> 25:33.480
You're the only one

409
25:34.800 --> 25:35.960
I can rely on here

410
25:36.200 --> 25:37.520
now.

411
26:05.610 --> 26:07.540
We must strengthen patrols today.

412
26:07.930 --> 26:09.060
Pass down the order.

413
26:09.520 --> 26:10.930
Anyone suspicious

414
26:11.350 --> 26:12.950
is to be killed immediately.

415
26:13.390 --> 26:14.000
Yes.

416
26:15.190 --> 26:16.280
Rotate the guards

417
26:17.110 --> 26:18.240
every four hours.

418
26:19.560 --> 26:20.040
Right.

419
26:21.910 --> 26:23.040
Doctor Su will be

420
26:23.650 --> 26:25.780
at the palace within an hour for my follow-up.

421
26:25.780 --> 26:27.440
Go to the gate and receive her.

422
26:27.720 --> 26:28.330
Yes.

423
26:36.000 --> 26:36.930
Dr. Su.

424
26:37.300 --> 26:38.150
Sorry to keep you waiting.

425
26:38.150 --> 26:39.280
I'm finally done.

426
26:40.000 --> 26:40.560
Come on.

427
26:41.960 --> 26:42.690
No need.

428
26:43.870 --> 26:44.420
What

429
26:45.480 --> 26:46.460
does this mean?

430
26:46.500 --> 26:46.710
The ointment needs to be applied

431
26:46.710 --> 26:48.760
[Doctor Su Jingxi]

432
26:48.760 --> 26:50.420
three times a day on schedule.

433
26:50.690 --> 26:51.980
Have you been doing it properly?

434
26:51.980 --> 26:53.560
I just forgot a few times.

435
26:53.850 --> 26:56.240
Why are you so upset?

436
26:57.330 --> 26:58.740
I'll apply it right now.

437
27:02.350 --> 27:03.330
It's too late.

438
27:04.340 --> 27:05.940
This is a disease of the mind.

439
27:08.310 --> 27:10.170
I don't have a disease of the mind.

440
27:13.330 --> 27:14.240
Eunuch Zhu.

441
27:14.480 --> 27:16.740
I just want to find the root cause for you.

442
27:17.110 --> 27:19.090
This condition is only 30% about the medicine.

443
27:19.090 --> 27:20.170
Recovery is key.

444
27:26.020 --> 27:27.410
After tonight,

445
27:29.740 --> 27:32.000
everything will be settled.

446
27:32.370 --> 27:33.430
That would be best.

447
27:35.650 --> 27:36.710
I'll take my leave.

448
27:39.450 --> 27:40.280
Dr. Su,

449
27:40.740 --> 27:41.470
please wait.

450
27:47.650 --> 27:49.200
I have one more request.

451
27:49.960 --> 27:50.930
Please speak.

452
27:51.720 --> 27:53.180
You must promise me first.

453
27:54.930 --> 27:56.370
What do you mean?

454
27:56.780 --> 27:58.510
I will be going to Beijing soon.

455
27:58.850 --> 27:59.760
Dr. Su,

456
28:00.720 --> 28:02.850
would you like to go to Beijing with me?

457
28:03.720 --> 28:04.280
Alright.

458
28:04.980 --> 28:06.130
I will go with you.

459
28:22.240 --> 28:25.850
[Beijing Imperial City]

460
28:26.190 --> 28:27.650
Has His Majesty awakened?

461
28:27.690 --> 28:28.280
No.

462
28:28.670 --> 28:30.600
Move a set of His Majesty's bedding

463
28:30.940 --> 28:32.670
and belongings to Qin'an Hall.

464
28:33.870 --> 28:35.160
I'll stay by his side day and night.

465
28:35.160 --> 28:36.260
[Empress, Zhang] [Hai Shou, Vice Director of the Directorate of the Imperial Stables]

466
28:36.260 --> 28:37.670
It'll put my mind at ease.

467
28:37.760 --> 28:38.410
Yes.

468
28:47.850 --> 28:48.610
Lord Lyu,

469
28:49.200 --> 28:49.960
rise.

470
28:50.590 --> 28:51.990
Thank you, Your Majesty.

471
28:54.260 --> 28:55.370
[Vice Minister of Rites, Lord Lyu]

472
28:55.370 --> 28:56.910
I received your decree ordering

473
28:56.910 --> 29:00.170
the heads of all government offices in the capital to enter the palace

474
29:00.170 --> 29:01.760
and summoning all vassal kings

475
29:01.760 --> 29:03.080
to the capital at once.

476
29:04.780 --> 29:05.960
I don't understand.

477
29:08.410 --> 29:09.560
His Majesty is ill,

478
29:10.000 --> 29:12.370
and the Crown Prince is far away.

479
29:13.150 --> 29:14.520
The safest course

480
29:14.800 --> 29:16.590
is to keep anyone with ulterior motives

481
29:16.590 --> 29:19.510
within my sight.

482
29:20.670 --> 29:22.170
In Your Majesty's eyes,

483
29:23.480 --> 29:25.520
who exactly has ulterior motives?

484
29:29.240 --> 29:31.150
I have my own reasons.

485
29:31.690 --> 29:32.490
Your Majesty,

486
29:32.980 --> 29:35.870
summoning all the vassal kings to the capital so conspicuously

487
29:35.870 --> 29:37.670
at such a time is tantamount to announcing

488
29:37.670 --> 29:39.720
to the realm that His Majesty is gravely ill.

489
29:39.720 --> 29:40.520
Your Majesty,

490
29:40.670 --> 29:42.470
I urge you to think this through.

491
29:46.270 --> 29:47.900
His Majesty is ill,

492
29:48.280 --> 29:50.080
and the Crown Prince is far away.

493
29:50.110 --> 29:52.090
Extraordinary times call for extraordinary measures.

494
29:52.090 --> 29:53.590
We'll decide what comes next

495
29:53.590 --> 29:55.050
as circumstances unfold.

496
29:56.120 --> 29:56.930
Lord Lyu.

497
29:59.260 --> 30:00.920
I take my leave, Your Majesty.

498
30:21.690 --> 30:22.890
What about Yuan Zhongda?

499
30:22.890 --> 30:23.650
Has the bamboo message tube for the Crown Prince

500
30:23.650 --> 30:25.000
been delivered to him?

501
30:25.170 --> 30:26.040
Your Majesty,

502
30:26.230 --> 30:28.310
it's over 2000 miles from Beijing to Jinling.

503
30:28.310 --> 30:30.510
Sent by express courier at 600 lis a day,

504
30:31.030 --> 30:33.690
it should arrive within the next couple of days.

505
30:34.190 --> 30:35.960
Lord Yuan has arrived.

506
30:38.410 --> 30:39.740
Bring the chess pieces.

507
30:45.100 --> 30:48.740
[Chief Minister, Yuan Zhongda]

508
30:49.700 --> 30:53.130
I just received

509
30:53.280 --> 30:54.690
an urgent dispatch

510
30:54.960 --> 30:56.290
from the capital today.

511
31:00.700 --> 31:02.000
An urgent dispatch?

512
31:02.910 --> 31:03.930
What is it about?

513
31:04.220 --> 31:06.350
It was sent by Her Majesty the Empress.

514
31:06.520 --> 31:07.320
She ordered me

515
31:07.520 --> 31:10.500
to hand this bamboo message tube to Your Highness personally,

516
31:10.500 --> 31:11.410
and instructed

517
31:11.540 --> 31:12.930
that Your Highness must

518
31:16.100 --> 31:17.130
read it alone.

519
31:26.560 --> 31:27.800
Help the sir up.

520
31:28.500 --> 31:29.960
Thank you, Your Highness.

521
31:30.720 --> 31:31.480
Leave us.

522
32:08.050 --> 32:12.180
[On the gengchen day of the fifth month, the Emperor fell ill.]

523
32:12.180 --> 32:16.320
[The Crown Prince should return to the capital immediately.]

524
32:31.580 --> 32:34.710
My mother wants me to return to the capital immediately.

525
32:38.090 --> 32:40.350
Jinling is over 2000 miles from Beijing.

526
32:41.190 --> 32:42.850
How can I return immediately?

527
32:46.740 --> 32:47.650
Your Highness.

528
32:51.720 --> 32:54.980
If it means Your Highness can return to the capital as soon as possible,

529
32:54.980 --> 32:58.310
I am willing to offer my humble assistance.

530
33:13.760 --> 33:15.890
My body really can't take it anymore.

531
33:15.930 --> 33:16.720
Yes.

532
33:29.130 --> 33:30.860
Let me go first. Let me go first.

533
33:41.280 --> 33:42.090
Wait a moment.

534
34:14.080 --> 34:17.139
The Prince of Jin, the Prince of Dai, and the Prince of Lu

535
34:17.290 --> 34:20.949
have arrived by imperial summons to await Your Majesty's decree.

536
34:33.060 --> 34:33.860
Your Majesty.

537
34:34.810 --> 34:36.230
The Three Dukes and Three Solitaries in the capital,

538
34:36.230 --> 34:37.210
the Ministers of the Six Ministries,

539
34:37.210 --> 34:39.580
the Vice Ministers, the Censors-in-Chief of the Censorate,

540
34:39.580 --> 34:41.179
and the vassal kings from neighboring provinces

541
34:41.179 --> 34:42.179
have all arrived.

542
34:44.020 --> 34:45.280
What about Prince Han?

543
34:46.290 --> 34:48.290
How far is Le'an Prefecture from Beijing?

544
34:48.290 --> 34:49.750
Why hasn't he arrived yet?

545
34:50.179 --> 34:51.159
Go and urge him.

546
34:51.679 --> 34:52.810
Within 3 days,

547
34:53.139 --> 34:55.010
he must stay here in Qin'an Hall.

548
34:55.710 --> 34:56.389
Yes.

549
34:56.870 --> 34:59.150
His Highness Prince Han has arrived on summons,

550
34:59.150 --> 35:01.880
awaiting the imperial decree.

551
35:01.910 --> 35:02.520
Go.

552
35:40.240 --> 35:42.240
[South Warden's Office]

553
35:42.550 --> 35:44.330
My Lord, our place is small.

554
35:44.450 --> 35:45.870
We usually just follow orders.

555
35:45.870 --> 35:47.560
You've brought so many prisoners all at once.

556
35:47.560 --> 35:49.140
Since you know to follow orders,

557
35:49.140 --> 35:50.430
why don't you follow the orders of the Eastern Palace?

558
35:50.430 --> 35:51.200
We will, we will.

559
35:51.200 --> 35:52.300
I hold this token.

560
35:52.500 --> 35:54.250
How dare the Warden's Office not recognize it?

561
35:54.250 --> 35:55.290
We do, we do.

562
35:55.330 --> 35:56.350
Interrogating key criminals

563
35:56.350 --> 35:57.120
and guarding the Imperial City

564
35:57.120 --> 35:58.560
are your duties.

565
35:58.750 --> 36:00.750
Do you expect me to handle it myself?

566
36:01.250 --> 36:03.080
I-I didn't say we wouldn't follow orders.

567
36:03.080 --> 36:05.010
Keep a close watch on these people.

568
36:06.790 --> 36:08.040
I will interrogate them

569
36:08.040 --> 36:08.970
one by one later.

570
36:09.180 --> 36:10.110
Little Xingren!

571
36:12.600 --> 36:13.250
Little Xingren!

572
36:13.250 --> 36:14.000
You guys,

573
36:14.290 --> 36:15.090
sit properly.

574
36:15.330 --> 36:16.480
Good-for-Nothing, I'm in trouble.

575
36:16.480 --> 36:17.560
Save me. Hurry!

576
36:17.580 --> 36:18.840
Wait, why are you here?

577
36:18.880 --> 36:19.010
[Bailonggua, Long Si]

578
36:19.010 --> 36:19.640
I was just watching the fun

579
36:19.640 --> 36:20.390
and didn't run in time.

580
36:20.390 --> 36:21.980
They pinned me to the ground.

581
36:21.980 --> 36:22.520
Guys,

582
36:23.120 --> 36:24.720
you've got the wrong person.

583
36:24.860 --> 36:26.320
Aren't you after the Iron Alliance?

584
36:26.320 --> 36:26.820
Look,

585
36:27.250 --> 36:28.330
members of the Iron Alliance

586
36:28.330 --> 36:29.830
have blades under their boots.

587
36:29.830 --> 36:31.470
Look at what he's wearing.

588
36:31.850 --> 36:32.560
Hemp shoes.

589
36:32.870 --> 36:34.060
You've got the wrong person.

590
36:34.060 --> 36:34.710
Let him go.

591
36:35.020 --> 36:36.150
Pin him down!

592
36:38.320 --> 36:38.950
Step back.

593
36:39.600 --> 36:41.580
Let's see who dares to touch him today.

594
36:41.580 --> 36:42.310
Wu Dingyuan,

595
36:42.440 --> 36:43.640
stop messing around.

596
36:43.840 --> 36:45.660
They are all wanted criminals of the court.

597
36:45.660 --> 36:46.790
If you're so capable,

598
36:46.790 --> 36:48.410
why don't you deal with the Iron Alliance

599
36:48.410 --> 36:50.060
instead of biting me back?

600
36:50.330 --> 36:52.180
Of course I will arrest the Iron Alliance people.

601
36:52.180 --> 36:53.380
But you took the money

602
36:53.580 --> 36:55.230
and didn't guard the door of Xinghua Restaurant.

603
36:55.230 --> 36:56.370
You are dishonest!

604
36:56.660 --> 36:57.330
Yes,

605
36:57.700 --> 36:59.240
I did take the money,

606
36:59.540 --> 37:01.060
but I'm not selling my life.

607
37:01.060 --> 37:01.960
Look for yourself.

608
37:01.960 --> 37:03.440
You made such a big scene,

609
37:03.640 --> 37:04.810
brought so many soldiers,

610
37:04.810 --> 37:05.870
and hacked at everyone you saw.

611
37:05.870 --> 37:06.960
How could I not run?

612
37:09.210 --> 37:10.890
Okay, let me ask you.

613
37:11.160 --> 37:12.520
Outside Xinghua Restaurant,

614
37:12.520 --> 37:14.120
there was a carriage parked.

615
37:14.120 --> 37:15.080
Did you see it?

616
37:17.100 --> 37:18.030
Little Xingren,

617
37:18.600 --> 37:20.210
watch your tone.

618
37:20.810 --> 37:21.940
Who do you think I am?

619
37:22.100 --> 37:23.190
Are you interrogating a prisoner?

620
37:23.190 --> 37:24.460
-Why are you arresting me? -Behave!

621
37:24.460 --> 37:25.250
What did I do?

622
37:25.390 --> 37:26.640
These Iron Alliance people

623
37:26.640 --> 37:28.500
never tell a single word of truth.

624
37:29.020 --> 37:29.680
Squat down!

625
37:29.770 --> 37:31.080
If you don't listen, you'll be beaten!

626
37:31.080 --> 37:31.960
Did you hear me?

627
37:32.230 --> 37:33.660
Previously, when my father and I

628
37:33.660 --> 37:36.870
were investigating the case of the missing Huliu explosive in the palace,

629
37:36.870 --> 37:38.470
we were just about to find out

630
37:39.000 --> 37:40.660
that the one smuggling the Huliu explosive

631
37:40.660 --> 37:43.030
was highly likely to be Lord Guo Zhimin.

632
37:43.730 --> 37:45.530
But when we arrived at his house,

633
37:45.690 --> 37:47.350
he had already been silenced.

634
37:47.710 --> 37:48.970
So the trail went cold.

635
37:50.710 --> 37:51.770
Not exactly.

636
37:52.830 --> 37:54.690
I found this at the Guo residence.

637
37:56.800 --> 37:58.360
[Puji Clinic]

638
37:58.360 --> 37:59.890
We can start investigating

639
37:59.890 --> 38:01.890
by looking into this prescription.

640
38:03.460 --> 38:04.810
[Su Jingxi]

641
38:08.250 --> 38:09.180
Little Xingren.

642
38:09.750 --> 38:10.480
Look.

643
38:10.770 --> 38:13.830
Members of the Iron Alliance have gathered in Jinling.

644
38:14.230 --> 38:16.390
They will definitely make their next move.

645
38:16.390 --> 38:17.600
The most urgent thing now

646
38:17.600 --> 38:19.600
is to act before they do.

647
38:20.100 --> 38:21.360
How does the saying go?

648
38:21.640 --> 38:23.500
To catch the bandits, first catch the ringleader.

649
38:23.500 --> 38:27.300
Catch the real culprit who blew up the Crown Prince's treasure ship.

650
38:27.910 --> 38:28.840
That way, you'll

651
38:28.910 --> 38:30.330
earn favor and rewards

652
38:30.540 --> 38:31.620
from the Crown Prince,

653
38:31.620 --> 38:32.190
right?

654
38:32.710 --> 38:34.240
I'm not asking for a reward!

655
38:34.950 --> 38:36.310
I ask that anyone who acts against His Highness the Crown Prince

656
38:36.310 --> 38:38.250
and commits such a heinous crime

657
38:38.620 --> 38:40.040
be condemned by the whole world!

658
38:40.040 --> 38:40.750
All right, all right.

659
38:40.750 --> 38:41.580
Save it.

660
38:41.830 --> 38:42.890
Don't give me that.

661
38:54.260 --> 38:56.010
[Puji Clinic]

662
38:56.010 --> 38:57.430
Are you sure this is the place?

663
38:57.430 --> 38:58.360
Little Xingren.

664
38:58.960 --> 39:00.290
Can't you read, either?

665
39:01.660 --> 39:02.480
I mean,

666
39:02.480 --> 39:04.210
is this the only Puji Clinic?

667
39:04.580 --> 39:06.140
Are there no other branches?

668
39:06.140 --> 39:07.740
If there are other branches,

669
39:07.750 --> 39:09.610
are we not going to check this one?

670
39:15.600 --> 39:16.450
Constable Wu.

671
39:17.370 --> 39:19.120
You don't have a problem picking locks, do you?

672
39:19.120 --> 39:20.310
I've actually come across

673
39:20.310 --> 39:21.480
a lock I can't pick.

674
39:22.060 --> 39:22.670
Look.

675
39:23.240 --> 39:25.040
This doctor is very meticulous.

676
39:26.000 --> 39:28.200
They filled the lock cylinder with wax.

677
39:30.890 --> 39:33.610
♪ Call me crazy, call me a coward ♪

678
39:33.630 --> 39:35.020
♪ The Qinhuai River breeds fools like me ♪

679
39:36.430 --> 39:39.260
♪ A knife tucked at my waist, wine burning in my throat ♪

680
39:39.290 --> 39:40.990
♪ Both feet planted in the mud ♪

681
39:42.060 --> 39:44.900
♪ I brave the wind, I hit the ground ♪

682
39:44.930 --> 39:46.610
♪ I take the blows head-on, never crying out in pain ♪

683
39:47.790 --> 39:50.830
♪ My life hangs by a thread, my worries buried in my bones ♪

684
39:50.850 --> 39:50.890
♪ Whatever I owe, I'll repay in time ♪

685
39:50.890 --> 39:53.090
Good-for-Nothing, don't mess around.

686
39:53.300 --> 39:54.650
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

687
39:54.670 --> 39:55.960
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

688
39:55.990 --> 39:57.490
♪ Swaying along— what's all the swaying for? ♪

689
39:58.740 --> 39:59.980
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

690
40:00.120 --> 40:01.360
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

691
40:01.380 --> 40:02.750
♪ Chasing them down— what am I chasing for? ♪

692
40:02.750 --> 40:04.200
With those feeble skills of yours,

693
40:04.200 --> 40:04.850
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

694
40:04.850 --> 40:05.810
you think you can take care of the Crown Prince?

695
40:05.810 --> 40:07.220
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

696
40:07.330 --> 40:09.030
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

697
40:09.850 --> 40:11.300
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

698
40:11.340 --> 40:12.730
♪ To hell with what the history books say ♪

699
40:12.750 --> 40:14.970
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

700
41:15.990 --> 41:16.700
Watch out!

701
41:22.980 --> 41:23.520
Sit down.

702
41:23.700 --> 41:24.280
Sit down.

703
41:24.860 --> 41:25.630
Sit down.

704
41:26.260 --> 41:27.390
Good-for-Nothing.

705
41:27.480 --> 41:28.290
After all, she's a...

706
41:28.290 --> 41:29.040
Woman.

707
41:30.550 --> 41:32.480
We constables, do things differently.

708
41:32.480 --> 41:34.080
We don't have those rules you scholars have

709
41:34.080 --> 41:35.930
about men and women not touching.

710
41:35.930 --> 41:36.970
You broke into someone's home

711
41:36.970 --> 41:38.480
and tied people up for no reason.

712
41:38.480 --> 41:40.060
Do you really think there's no law in Jinling?

713
41:40.060 --> 41:40.870
Behave!

714
41:52.640 --> 41:54.100
What's your relationship

715
41:54.560 --> 41:55.760
with Lord Guo Zhimin?

716
42:00.330 --> 42:01.770
I found a prescription

717
42:01.820 --> 42:02.990
on the table in the Guo residence

718
42:02.990 --> 42:04.340
that you wrote for him.

719
42:10.050 --> 42:11.390
I'm his fiancée.

720
42:11.960 --> 42:13.490
He was restless a while ago,

721
42:14.180 --> 42:16.380
so I prescribed him something to sleep.

722
42:16.540 --> 42:17.600
He's already dead.

723
42:17.660 --> 42:18.410
Did you know?

724
42:18.840 --> 42:19.380
Yes.

725
42:19.640 --> 42:20.440
How did he die?

726
42:21.560 --> 42:22.850
You wouldn't think I killed him

727
42:22.850 --> 42:25.110
just based on a prescription, would you?

728
42:26.290 --> 42:27.090
Let me ask you.

729
42:28.000 --> 42:29.410
What's your relationship with the Iron Alliance?

730
42:29.410 --> 42:30.210
What?

731
42:30.560 --> 42:32.080
-Little Xingren. -Iron Alliance!

732
42:32.080 --> 42:34.520
You can't talk to a beauty like that.

733
42:36.100 --> 42:38.640
My name is Su Jingxi, from Yangzhou.

734
42:39.330 --> 42:42.000
I'm from the third branch of the Su family in Wanfuqiao.

735
42:42.000 --> 42:43.600
My family has practiced medicine for generations.

736
42:43.600 --> 42:45.290
I'm not from the Iron Alliance.

737
42:45.290 --> 42:45.810
You...

738
42:48.930 --> 42:49.500
What are you doing?

739
42:49.500 --> 42:50.410
Behave!

740
42:52.500 --> 42:53.210
Don't move.

741
42:59.370 --> 43:01.120
A token from the Directorate of the Imperial Stables

742
43:01.120 --> 43:03.380
used to enter and exit the Imperial City.

743
43:05.210 --> 43:06.930
How do you have Eunuch Zhu's token?
